    "### `ACTIONS` section\n",
    "\n",
    "The `ACTIONS` section defines actions (i.e., treatments). This part of our model is very simple, so it is easy to code this by hand."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 82,
   "id": "a554ec7b-8186-4d06-8703-a7556d111770",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "actions_section = \\\n",
    "\"\"\"\n",
    "ACTIONS\n",
    "*ACTION harvest 0\n",
    "*OPERABLE harvest\n",
    "? 1 ? ? ? _AGE >= 80 AND _AGE <= 999\n",
    "\"\"\""
   ]
  },
